# unit_course_records: the course select's records panel from the
# course grid (menus_course_grid_01): CourseRecordsSelectStep (02:E648)
# scrolling in and out, on each page and row with Up, Down and nothing
# (group 1 open and closed), and with the panel up ($0D44), where
# CourseRecordsKey leaves through its frame; CourseRecordsKey (02:E60D)
# with nothing pressed; the panel's states CourseRecordsOpening
# (02:E750), CourseRecordsReopen (02:E76B), CourseRecordsClosing
# (02:E781) and CourseRecordsShown (02:E795) at their ends and counting,
# the level column pulse at each threshold.
